  "details": "The input field (in VR) currently sits in an uncomfortable position and currently cannot be moved. The keyboard can (and current live branch can) so it feels unnatural that the input field is locked in one position after opening.\n\nThis requests for the ability to move the input field just like the keyboard and big menu. I would prefer if the input was attached on the top of the keyboard.",
